# Original game assets — never commit Cavedog's copyrighted content
assets/

# Build output (build/, build-dbg/, build-asan/, …)
build*/
# Packaged binary bundles (dist-win/, dist-macos/) — never commit binaries
dist*/
.cache/
compile_commands.json

# Game-derived HPI archives dropped at the repo root (never commit)
/*.hpi
/*.HPI

# Extracted retail data — hpitool/gaftool/etc. dump into the working dir, and
# accidental extraction outdirs have been committed before (see CLAUDE.md). Ignore
# the known offenders plus retail asset formats anywhere so they can't slip back in.
# (overrides/click.hpi is an intentional, project-authored override and stays tracked.)
